# PRIV-31: A highlight made in incognito does not survive process death.
#
# launch-task, not launch-view. The point is that the task resumes into the same
# incognito session and finds nothing to replay, because the recovery journal was
# never written. A fresh VIEW intent would prove nothing about replay.
describe An incognito highlight is lost with the process and is not replayed

# Opens normal.pdf with the incognito extra, makes one highlight on page 1,
# confirms the highlight exists and no journal was written, then backgrounds the
# app.
phase com.gitlab.mudlej.MjPdfReader.suite.privacy.Priv31ProcessDeathTest#phaseOneHighlightInIncognitoAndBackground

kill-app
# Relaunch only after phase-two instrumentation has started, so its startup
# force-stop cannot erase the restored incognito activity.
launch-task-after-start

# Asserts page 1 comes back clean, the unsaved indicator is gone, and the session
# is still incognito with nothing recorded.
phase com.gitlab.mudlej.MjPdfReader.suite.privacy.Priv31ProcessDeathTest#phaseTwoAssertNothingIsReplayed
